<title>USA: Dentsply approves additional share buyback.</title>
<headline>Dentsply approves additional share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dentsply International Inc said Wednesday it will repurchase up to 2.7 million more shares of its common stock, or about 10 percent of its outstanding shares, in calendar 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it has about 26.9 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe that our stock continues to represent a very attractive investment,&quot; the company said in a release.</p>
<p>Shares of the dental products maker and distributor were up 3/8 early Wednesday afternoon at 46-3/4.</p>
</text>
